      topicId: "asset-benefits-realization-review",
      prompt: "Order the steps for a benefits realization review of a completed renewal program.",
      assumptions: "Fictional western Canadian distribution system operating under provincial drinking water requirements and the Guidelines for Canadian Drinking Water Quality.",
